## Configuration and Tuning

### Configuration Parameters

{expand:title=Counter System Configuration}
{code:sql|title=Configuration Parameters}
-- Maximum number of blockchain tables (default: 1000)
SET blockchain.max_tables = 2000;

-- Counter persistence interval in seconds (default: 300)
SET blockchain.counter_persist_interval = 600;

-- Enable counter statistics collection (default: on)
SET blockchain.counter_stats = on;

-- Counter recovery timeout in milliseconds (default: 30000)
SET blockchain.recovery_timeout = 60000;

-- Background persistence process (default: on)
SET blockchain.background_persistence = on;
{code}
{expand}

### Performance Tuning

{section}
{column:width=50%}
{panel:title=Memory Tuning|borderColor=#4CAF50|titleBGColor=#E8F5E8}
